+// HST Office: the geometry of the approved 1.0.2 ribbon mockup (plans/261115-2225-ribbon-mockup-1-0-2/reference/
+// mockup-expected.json, geometry_px): the sizes of the large (L), medium (M), small (S) and folded (C) buttons and
+// of a group's frame. Plain integer arithmetic without LibreOffice types, so it is unit tested on its own
+// (tests/unit/test_ribbon_mockup_geometry.py compiles it from the patch with a test driver).
+//
+// Every constant is in logical px; px() turns it into device px once, where it is used (one rounding per value,
+// so 150 % lays out the same as 100 % within a pixel).
+
