+/// Ids of the .ui files: VclBuilder hands an unknown .ui property to Window::set_property, which drops it, so the
+/// data lives here. An id the applications share names its group by a sibling only that application has.
+bool keepsLarge(const vcl::Window& rWindow)
+{
